&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A career driven by you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. As &lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO Lead&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll own the &lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO strategy&lt;/strong&gt; behind one of Europe&#39;s leading digital marketplaces. Working at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;SEO&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Product&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll build scalable technical solutions that drive organic growth across multiple markets.&lt;/p&gt;
